        "**Purpose three: plan drugs, fasting, thromboprophylaxis and antibiotic prophylaxis** - each has a fixed timing set in advance. [ASA 2023]",
        "**Purpose four: inform consent and shared decision-making** - including the option of not operating, which is always an alternative. [ASA 2023]",
        "**No patient is fit or unfit in the abstract - fitness is relative to the magnitude of the planned procedure.** [ASA 2023]",
        "**A lipoma excision under local and an open aortic operation need different work-ups in the same patient** - pair reserve against operation. [ASA 2023]",
        "**Grade with the ASA physical status classification, I to VI, suffix E for emergency** - it is the common language between clinicians. [ASA 2020]",
        "**ASA describes the patient, not the operation** - it correlates with morbidity and mortality but is criticised as subjective. [ASA 2020]",
