        "**Offer it to ventilated patients who will not be extubated within a week or two** - that is the whole clinical decision. [Bailey and Love 28e 2023]",
        "**The price is that the nose is bypassed**, so inspired air is no longer warmed, humidified or filtered. [Dhingra 8e]",
        "**The cough is weakened because the glottis cannot close**, so pressure cannot be built before the expulsive phase. [Dhingra 8e]",
        "**Swallowing is impaired and the voice is lost until the airway is partly restored** - all routine care follows from these four losses. [Dhingra 8e]",
